    "q-164407": {
      "dom_id": "step-q164407",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Identify the following surface: \n\n$$\nz=1+(x-1)^{2}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{9}\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that the equation of an elliptic paraboloid centered at $O$ is given by\n\n$$\nz=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}},\n$$\n\nand an elliptic paraboloid centered at $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ is given by\n\n$$\nz-{z}_{0}=\\frac{(x-{x}_{0})^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-{y}_{0})^{2}}{{b}^{2}},\n$$\n\nThus, our equation is an elliptic paraboloid with the following parameters:\n\n$$\n({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})=(1,2,1),\\,a=1,\\,b=3.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-164407-a",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A hyperbolic paraboloid",
              "html": "A hyperbolic paraboloid"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-164407-b",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A hyperboloid of two sheets",
              "html": "A hyperboloid of two sheets"
            },
            {
              "option": "c",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-164407-c",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "An elliptic paraboloid",
              "html": "An elliptic paraboloid"
            },
            {
              "option": "d",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-164407-d",
